<p>Prince Harry is facing a defamation lawsuit in London’s High Court from Sentebale, the African charity he co-founded in 2006 to honor his mother, Princess Diana. The charity supports children and young people living with HIV in Lesotho and Botswana. It filed the claim after a rupture that led Harry to resign as patron last year, following a dispute between trustees and the chair of the board. Court records reviewed by multiple outlets show that Harry and former trustee Mark Dyer are being sued for libel or slander, though the full legal filings were not publicly available on Friday. A spokesperson for Harry said he “categorically” rejects the claim as offensive and damaging, underscoring how a charity created to help vulnerable young people has become the center of a public legal fight.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/7WtoZJaRZMIxocEDxnmbM7waN_xSjhqppxbyQHHG3yydfL917f9OXdq7MZ_lzc-pKhV4y2K5IiNS-O9V88kUtqwacuajbVzeCSlBQxyYq3wOqUWF1EOVeP8Li7zLU7rLhyQWEp64BHhtv3qoWAKNEwMGx2D9ztlBzMa7_DNb3oxhDAelcTlo6-telN46yNnkgr4a3TRWh-r47g' alt='Prince Harry in a confidence building exercise with young people at the Kasane Health Post in Botswana, during a summit run by Sentebale in 2019.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Named defendants: Online court filings list both Prince Harry and Mark Dyer, a longtime friend of Harry’s and a former Sentebale trustee, as defendants in the case.</li><li>Charity mission: Sentebale works with young people affected by HIV in Botswana and Lesotho, continuing a mission that several outlets say began in southern Africa nearly two decades ago.</li><li>Unusual position: The High Court claim puts Harry in the less familiar role of defendant, after years of appearing in British courts mainly as a claimant against media organizations.</li><li>Public fallout: The lawsuit follows a public war of words tied to disagreements inside the charity’s leadership, with reports describing a falling-out involving the board of trustees and the board chair.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Prince Harry spokesperson: Harry rejects the libel allegation and called it an offensive and damaging claim. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/4/10/prince-harry-sued-for-defamation-by-sentebale-charity-he-co-founded'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li><li>Sentebale: The charity said it launched legal proceedings over what it described as reputational harm. (<a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/african-charity-sues-prince-harry-for-defamation-11341259#publisher=newsstand'>NDTV</a>)</li><li>Court filings: The publicly visible High Court record shows a formal legal dispute, but not the underlying allegations, because the full documents were not available. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3349711/prince-harry-sued-african-charity-he-set-honour-princess-diana'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-prince-harry-sued-for-libel-by-african-aids-charity-he-co-founded-then/'>Prince Harry sued for libel by African AIDS charity he co-founded, then quit after dispute</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3349711/prince-harry-sued-african-charity-he-set-honour-princess-diana'>Prince Harry sued by African charity he set up to honour Princess Diana</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/10/world/europe/prince-harry-sentebale-libel-lawsuit.html'>Prince Harry Is Sued for Libel by a Charity He Founded</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/apr/10/prince-harry-sued-defamation-charity-sentebale'>Prince Harry sued for defamation by charity he co-founded</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/4/10/prince-harry-sued-for-defamation-by-sentebale-charity-he-co-founded'>Prince Harry sued for defamation by Sentebale charity he co-founded</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/int